     1097   ON CHOOSE OF B-chg IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1098   DO:
     1099     run proc-b-chg in this-procedure no-error.
     1100       if error-status:error then do:
     1101           assign add-option = "":U.
     1102           return no-apply.
     1103     end.
     1104   END.
     1105   ON CHOOSE OF B-rev IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1106   DO:
     1107     run proc-b-rev in this-procedure no-error.
